      "subject": "Shemer \/ Shomeron",
      "rationale": "Dugu tɔgɔ bɔra kulu tigi tɔgɔ la — Shemer → Shomeron; tɔgɔda dilannen in ye masakɛya kɔrɔda daɲɛ ye."
