      "subject": "kikɛ fila warigwɛ",
      "rationale": "San ni sɔngɔ dɔgɔtɔrɔ jira: kikɛ fila (talents) warigwɛ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "kikɛ",
      "rationale": "ככר (kikar) ye jatebaga ye min ka bo ni misi kɔnɔ; 'kikɛ' (talent) ye sɛbɛnni-yɛlɛma ye, a tɛ Bamanankan kɔrɔda daɲɛ ye."
    }
