  "translation": "A ye ⟨את⟩ kulu min tɔgɔ ye Shomeron, san ⟨את⟩ Shemer fɛ ni warigwɛ kikɛ fila ye; a ye ⟨את⟩ kulu in dia, ka ⟨את⟩ dugu tɔgɔ min o ye dia, wele Shemer, kulu tigi, tɔgɔ la — Shomeron.",
